UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It turns out EW have a heart fit, but impossible to find it. And North should not have drawn a 3rd round of trump. Declarer could have cashed the @CK and the @HAK, cross ruffed, and taken one more trick. But fortunately it made anyway and good thing I didn't try for game.|
