UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now let's discuss the suit combination of when you have @HAxx opposite @HKxxx (or @HKxx opposite @HAxxx) and also hold the 10 and 9. The best way to play that suit is to cash the the Ace and King. You will take 3 tricks anytime the suit is 3-3 or the Jack or Queen is singleton or doubleton which is 50%. A 3-3 break is 40% and a doubleton honor is around 10%. I don't expect you to memorize all suit combinations. However, those that are fairly common are worth learning.|
PG| ***** 65 ***** |


