mb|1D|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I think pass by North is fine. On the other hand, by adding one point for the 3 honors in diamonds, North would have 15 and could overcall 1N. But being vulnerable that is a stretch.|
PG| ***** 67 ***** |


mb|1H|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|1S|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East has no good bid here. Obviously, East would like to bid 2@C and hope to play in clubs or hearts. But 2@C is game forcing and doesn't even show clubs. It is artificial. So I would bid 2@H with the East hand and hope partner has at least 2 to an honor. But 1N is also possible.|
PG| ***** 68 ***** |


