nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have no good lead. I would lead a club but I hate leading unprotected aces. I might lead a heart but given my holding it could easily give away a trick.|
PG| ***** 70 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West could easily have 4 spades and 5 diamonds. So I don't like leading either of those suits. But it turns out a heart is best, but that is only because partner has an honor. So I will reluctantly lead the @CA.|
PG| ***** 71 ***** |


